  title: Gautama Buddha
  text: Siddhartha Gautama was born at Lumbini, in present-day Nepal, into the Shakya clan. He left home at twenty-nine, attained enlightenment at Bodh Gaya, gave his first sermon at Sarnath and died at Kushinagar at the age of eighty.
